{% doc %}
  header.cart-slideout.liquid
  Place in: /snippets/header.cart-slideout.liquid

  Slideout cart using header.drawer positioned as a full-height side panel.
  Identical functionality to dropdown — same events, same JS, same cart behavior.
  Visual difference achieved through CSS only.
{% enddoc %}

